Icon?
._*

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux
.directory
*~

# ----------------------------
# Build / Output folders
# ----------------------------
bin

# NOTE: "sim_results" used to be ignored here (inherited from upstream
# EdgeCloudSim, where it's disposable build output). For SCOPE it holds the
# actual result data behind the paper's figures, so it's deliberately NOT
# ignored anymore. See the root README for how the large files in it
# (anything too big for a normal git push) are hosted instead.

